      "rawCompletion": {
        "text": "To achieve the desired functionality, we need to add a button with the id `clear-filter` to the HTML and modify the JavaScript code to handle the click event on this button. When the button is clicked, we will clear the value of the `#filterbox` input field and set the `display` style of all items in the list to `''`, effectively making them visible again.\n\nHere's the updated HTML and JavaScript code:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head><title>s07</title></head>\n<body>\n<h2>s07</h2>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"filterbox\">\n<button id=\"clear-filter\">Clear Filter</button>\n<div id=\"people\">\n  <p class=\"item\">nadia</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">nasser</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">oleg</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">priya</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">ravi</p>\n</div>\n<script>\nconst field = document.getElementById('filterbox');\nconst rows = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#people .item'));\nconst clearFilterButton = document.getElementById('clear-filter');\n\nfunction apply() {\n  const q = field.value.toLowerCase();\n  rows.forEach(function (el) {\n    const hit = el.textContent.toLowerCase().indexOf(q) !== -1;\n    el.style.display = hit ? '' : 'none';\n  });\n}\n\nfield.addEventListener('keyup', apply);\n\nclearFilterButton.addEventListener('click', function () {\n  field.value = '';\n  rows.forEach(function (el) {\n    el.style.display = '';\n  });\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n### Explanation:\n\n1. **HTML Structure:**\n   - Added a `<button>` element with the id `clear-filter` to the HTML.\n   - The `#filterbox` input field remains unchanged.\n\n2. **JavaScript Code:**\n   - The `apply` function remains the same, which filters the items based on the value in the `#filterbox`.\n   - The `clearFilterButton` is added to the HTML.\n   - The `clearFilterButton` has an event listener that clears the value of the `#filterbox` and sets the `display` style of all items in the list to `''`, making them visible again.\n\nThis way, when the user clicks the \"Clear Filter\" button, the `#filterbox` is cleared, and all items in the list are displayed again, while typing in the filter still narrows the list.",
